/*
  Component:  Spur gear m2-z40
  Standard:   ISO 21771 involute geometry (parametric)
  Family:     external involute spur gear
  Size:       m2-z40
  Data source: Involute gear formulas follow ISO 21771 / standard gear practice. Tip/root arcs are polygonal approximations. Root fillet is not modeled. See components/DATA_SOURCES.md.
  Notes:      External involute spur gear with optional central bore. Sharp root corners; no hub, keyway, or fillet.
  Features modeled:      body, involute-tooth-envelope
  Features approximated: involute-flank (PolylineArc, deviation 1.4311152958591309 mm, control involute_points=12 (upper bound)); tip-and-root-arc (PolylineArc, deviation 3.197059634525957 mm, control arc_points=8 (upper bound)); bore (PolylineArc, deviation 0.006022718974137975 mm, control circle_segments=64)
  Features omitted:      hub (no hub or web is modelled); keyway (not modelled; represent it with an evaluated cut); root-fillet (sharp root corners at this builder); tip-chamfer (not modelled by this builder); undercut (not modelled; the profile is the theoretical involute)
  Feature tolerance:     0.01 mm
*/
FILE_DESCRIPTION(('Spur gear m2-z40'),'2;1');
